(249370, 16704, 6663, '<td valign="top">I thought about trying this but I''ve not seen a butterfly all week in my garden :( Well-taken pic.</td>', 'I thought about trying this but I''ve not seen a butterfly all week in my garden :( Well-taken pic.', '2003-03-31 04:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(249372, 16604, 6663, '<td valign="top">Er...symmetry please?</td>', 'Er...symmetry please?', '2003-03-31 04:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(249373, 16654, 6663, '<td valign="top">That''s ''kaleidoscope'' - sorry I''m a bit of a spelling geek! Nice idea but perhaps could have done without the black outline - fuzzes up the exterior of the image inside.</td>', 'That''s ''kaleidoscope'' - sorry I''m a bit of a spelling geek! Nice idea but perhaps could have done without the black outline - fuzzes up the exterior of the image inside.', '2003-03-31 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(249375, 16472, 6663, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea. New washing machine/dryer? Very original, and symmetric to boot. 8.</td>', 'GREAT idea. New washing machine/dryer? Very original, and symmetric to boot. 8.', '2003-03-31 04:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(249377, 16537, 6663, '<td valign="top">It feels a little empty in the middle - too much sky/sky reflection. Nice idea tho.</td>', 'It feels a little empty in the middle - too much sky/sky reflection. Nice idea tho.', '2003-03-31 04:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(249378, 16387, 6663, '<td valign="top">Waugh! Don''t worry - there are doctors can sort this sort of thing out for you nowadays... :) Coming to a ''How''d They Do That?'' near to you soon? Very original idea for the shot, really stands out from the crowd. well-executed too. 8.</td>', 'Waugh! Don''t worry - there are doctors can sort this sort of thing out for you nowadays... :) Coming to a ''How''d They Do That?'' near to you soon? Very original idea for the shot, really stands out from the crowd. well-executed too. 8.', '2003-03-31 04:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(249380, 16638, 6663, '<td valign="top">I thought about trying something like this, but I couldn''t get it to work - am I just a bit of a plank, and it''s actually simple? Lovely colours to choose though. Works very well. 8.</td>', 'I thought about trying something like this, but I couldn''t get it to work - am I just a bit of a plank, and it''s actually simple? Lovely colours to choose though. Works very well. 8.', '2003-03-31 04:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(249381, 16729, 6663, '<td valign="top">Pity you didn''t catch the tree in the left foreground on the right. More original than a lot of this week''s ''reflection from water'' shots though...</td>', 'Pity you didn''t catch the tree in the left foreground on the right. More original than a lot of this week''s ''reflection from water'' shots though...', '2003-03-31 04:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
