(249392, 16135, 6663, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Perfect title, symmetric shot, made me laugh out loud. My favourite so far. 9.</td>', 'Excellent. Perfect title, symmetric shot, made me laugh out loud. My favourite so far. 9.', '2003-03-31 04:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(249393, 16630, 6663, '<td valign="top">Wow, one of the better ''water reflection'' shots this week - I particularly like the appearance of the coulds in the water. And you managed to pull off shooting into the sun - usually a no-no. Well-taken photo. 8.</td>', 'Wow, one of the better ''water reflection'' shots this week - I particularly like the appearance of the coulds in the water. And you managed to pull off shooting into the sun - usually a no-no. Well-taken photo. 8.', '2003-03-31 04:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(249395, 16072, 6663, '<td valign="top">Photo is a bit shallow. Can''t make out what the fire is lighting here.</td>', 'Photo is a bit shallow. Can''t make out what the fire is lighting here.', '2003-03-31 05:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(249396, 16495, 6663, '<td valign="top">Pic is very small - I guess it''s ''straight to the point'' then! Not a bad pic but a little asymmetric.</td>', 'Pic is very small - I guess it''s ''straight to the point'' then! Not a bad pic but a little asymmetric.', '2003-03-31 05:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(249398, 16690, 6663, '<td valign="top">Wow! As if trying to hit as many of the recent weeks'' themes as y0ou can at once - The Egg, Kitchen Utensils, Symmetry - get a bridge in there and you''ve won a prize! Seriously though - a very nice shot with excellent symmetry. 8.</td>', 'Wow! As if trying to hit as many of the recent weeks'' themes as y0ou can at once - The Egg, Kitchen Utensils, Symmetry - get a bridge in there and you''ve won a prize! Seriously though - a very nice shot with excellent symmetry. 8.', '2003-03-31 05:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(249399, 16649, 6663, '<td valign="top">The colour contrast and shape of the building give this picture a very other-worldy feel - a bit disarming but I like it. Despite small bits of asymmetry present, I still feel the symmetry just from the main subject of the pic. Well-taken - maybe could have cropped the sky a little more. 7.</td>', 'The colour contrast and shape of the building give this picture a very other-worldy feel - a bit disarming but I like it. Despite small bits of asymmetry present, I still feel the symmetry just from the main subject of the pic. Well-taken - maybe could have cropped the sky a little more. 7.', '2003-03-31 05:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(249400, 16657, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very effective in spite of (or perhaps because of) its simplicity. Even in the title. Strongly-themed.</td>', 'Very effective in spite of (or perhaps because of) its simplicity. Even in the title. Strongly-themed.', '2003-03-31 05:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(249401, 16752, 6663, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the title - or possibly was the idea for the pic from an idea for the title?</td>', 'Good idea for the title - or possibly was the idea for the pic from an idea for the title?', '2003-03-31 05:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
