(249403, 16388, 6663, '<td valign="top">What is this a shot of? It''s very interesting anyway - really draws the eye. Meets the challenge well. 7.</td>', 'What is this a shot of? It''s very interesting anyway - really draws the eye. Meets the challenge well. 7.', '2003-03-31 05:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
