(250624, 16460, 4494, '<td valign="top">The picture is really titled to the left.  I''m surprised how many off center photos I see.  Seems like that would be the first thing to fix.   I like the toning effect on the picture however.  And to get a better effect of symetry maybe you should have zoomed in to the building a little more.</td>', 'The picture is really titled to the left.  I''m surprised how many off center photos I see.  Seems like that would be the first thing to fix.   I like the toning effect on the picture however.  And to get a better effect of symetry maybe you should have zoomed in to the building a little more.', '2003-03-31 18:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
