(251524, 16565, 3290, '<td valign="top">Eyecatching thumbnail, nice shot. I like the pastel colours and the composition. I know if I''d taken this I would have wanted to include the apex of the triangle and perhaps get what I assume is a flat area at the top of the steps. Yours works much better than mine would have done. Well done.</td>', 'Eyecatching thumbnail, nice shot. I like the pastel colours and the composition. I know if I''d taken this I would have wanted to include the apex of the triangle and perhaps get what I assume is a flat area at the top of the steps. Yours works much better than mine would have done. Well done.', '2003-04-01 11:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(251525, 16651, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of a swan in an unusual pose. Good reflection. A little overblown on the swan''s flank though.</td>', 'Nice catch of a swan in an unusual pose. Good reflection. A little overblown on the swan''s flank though.', '2003-04-01 11:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(251526, 16149, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Weird hand. Good execution.</td>', 'Nice idea. Weird hand. Good execution.', '2003-04-01 11:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(251529, 16124, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good colour in the water and a good pose.</td>', 'I like it. Good colour in the water and a good pose.', '2003-04-01 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(251530, 16201, 3724, '<td valign="top">.....composition and shapes of shell  pendant and shadow are interesting..... I would have tried a tighter crop and worked on fine focus.  The soft pastel colours have great potential.</td>', '.....composition and shapes of shell  pendant and shadow are interesting..... I would have tried a tighter crop and worked on fine focus.  The soft pastel colours have great potential.', '2003-04-01 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(251531, 16482, 3724, '<td valign="top">......nine.</td>', '......nine.', '2003-04-01 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(251535, 16292, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone and balance in this image. Sepia is a perfect color choice for this particular subject. I''m reminded of how much effort went into making machines back in the pre-plastic era.</td>', 'I really like the tone and balance in this image. Sepia is a perfect color choice for this particular subject. I''m reminded of how much effort went into making machines back in the pre-plastic era.', '2003-04-01 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(251538, 16688, 7560, '<td valign="top">This could be a very good image, but it''s lacking a strong focus point. You had a very good idea though.</td>', 'This could be a very good image, but it''s lacking a strong focus point. You had a very good idea though.', '2003-04-01 11:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(251542, 16595, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice maco! A perfect example of natural symmetry. How''d you keep the dog from  licking the camera while you were shooting?</td>', 'Nice maco! A perfect example of natural symmetry. How''d you keep the dog from  licking the camera while you were shooting?', '2003-04-01 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(251545, 16700, 7560, '<td valign="top">A good image with the problem that the tent? in the left background throws off the balance of the image, making it non-symmetrical.</td>', 'A good image with the problem that the tent? in the left background throws off the balance of the image, making it non-symmetrical.', '2003-04-01 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(251546, 16554, 7560, '<td valign="top">very strong image, excellent balance. It looks like it''s off by about 1.5 degrees right rotation. The tatto is also a bit off. I like the drops of water on the model though.</td>', 'very strong image, excellent balance. It looks like it''s off by about 1.5 degrees right rotation. The tatto is also a bit off. I like the drops of water on the model though.', '2003-04-01 12:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(251550, 16360, 7560, '<td valign="top">The tones aren''t quite right for me. I;m expecting to see true black/white, but the colors seem muddy. There''s also what appears to be noise/grain on the black part of the background. The whole image feels excessively soft fo me. But I do like the concept and your choice of models.</td>', 'The tones aren''t quite right for me. I;m expecting to see true black/white, but the colors seem muddy. There''s also what appears to be noise/grain on the black part of the background. The whole image feels excessively soft fo me. But I do like the concept and your choice of models.', '2003-04-01 12:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(251558, 16503, 3540, '<td valign="top">psycho fish.  Strange effect.  Looks like pop art more than a photograph, which is cool in its own right.  But for this, I don''t really like it.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'psycho fish.  Strange effect.  Looks like pop art more than a photograph, which is cool in its own right.  But for this, I don''t really like it.  Sorry.  5', '2003-04-01 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(251561, 16537, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks very similar to my shot.  Its sort of running downhill from right to left which I think affects this picture some.  The trick that I did was I flipped mine upside down, so the "water" as it appears is really really clear (because it''s really the sky).  Actually I turned it 180 degrees and then I flipped it about the horizon.  Good image though</td>', 'This looks very similar to my shot.  Its sort of running downhill from right to left which I think affects this picture some.  The trick that I did was I flipped mine upside down, so the "water" as it appears is really really clear (because it''s really the sky).  Actually I turned it 180 degrees and then I flipped it about the horizon.  Good image though', '2003-04-01 12:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
