(252002, 16773, 6025, '<td valign="top">Interresting, but this picture has been sharpened to death. Try being a little lighter on your USM. (3)</td>', 'Interresting, but this picture has been sharpened to death. Try being a little lighter on your USM. (3)', '2003-04-01 18:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(252007, 16554, 6025, '<td valign="top">Symmetry? Yes, sure. But slightly out of focus (might be focussing or might be motion blur), and I think the whole oiled-up-and-splashed-with-waterdrops idea is a bit used. If you allow my testosterone-ridden chauvinism to be heard for a second; Nice ass ;) (5)</td>', 'Symmetry? Yes, sure. But slightly out of focus (might be focussing or might be motion blur), and I think the whole oiled-up-and-splashed-with-waterdrops idea is a bit used. If you allow my testosterone-ridden chauvinism to be heard for a second; Nice ass ;) (5)', '2003-04-01 18:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(252010, 16769, 7413, '<td valign="top">Cool idea</td>', 'Cool idea', '2003-04-01 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(252016, 16728, 7291, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the Symmetry in this shot but I love the concept of shooting through Bubble Wrap.</td>', 'I don''t see the Symmetry in this shot but I love the concept of shooting through Bubble Wrap.', '2003-04-01 19:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
