(252067, 16706, 7291, '<td valign="top">What an ominous feel the sky in this picture gives!  And there is good symmetry here too.</td>', 'What an ominous feel the sky in this picture gives!  And there is good symmetry here too.', '2003-04-01 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
