(252080, 16710, 6025, '<td valign="top">I just have to ask.. Is the name of the person to the left Michaela Renner? If yes, I went to school with her some years ago.. On a more photographical level: Not reeeealy symmetrical, but not bad either. Too bad that you didn''t get both in focus (7)</td>', 'I just have to ask.. Is the name of the person to the left Michaela Renner? If yes, I went to school with her some years ago.. On a more photographical level: Not reeeealy symmetrical, but not bad either. Too bad that you didn''t get both in focus (7)', '2003-04-01 19:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
