(252342, 16637, 6870, '<td valign="top">What draws me to this image is that it is so common, yet the perspective you offer keeps my interest.</td>', 'What draws me to this image is that it is so common, yet the perspective you offer keeps my interest.', '2003-04-01 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
