(252345, 16659, 6870, '<td valign="top">It was hidden, and normally I would want the benches to somehow stick out a little. But with this image, you show me that the benches are a part of this place, and not detached from it.</td>', 'It was hidden, and normally I would want the benches to somehow stick out a little. But with this image, you show me that the benches are a part of this place, and not detached from it.', '2003-04-01 23:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
