(252347, 16649, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking Star Trek. Very interesting building. Possibly a stronger shot if you shot from under the bridge leading to the building?</td>', 'I''m thinking Star Trek. Very interesting building. Possibly a stronger shot if you shot from under the bridge leading to the building?', '2003-04-01 23:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(252349, 16176, 7291, '<td valign="top">Not only a wonderful picture for this challenge but would also do well for the current challenge.  A bit too much movement in the water but that (of course) is beyond your control.  Awesome!!!  One of my favorites for sure.</td>', 'Not only a wonderful picture for this challenge but would also do well for the current challenge.  A bit too much movement in the water but that (of course) is beyond your control.  Awesome!!!  One of my favorites for sure.', '2003-04-01 23:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
