(252366, 16648, 6325, '<td valign="top">Composition is OK - could have made the edges more defined, Exposue is a little flat - I expect this was very bright - in very bright scenes, the auto exposure actually tries to make it neutral gray, so you need to "over expose" it to compensate. The picture needs to be squared up - either at the time the picture is taken or with post processing.</td>', 'Composition is OK - could have made the edges more defined, Exposue is a little flat - I expect this was very bright - in very bright scenes, the auto exposure actually tries to make it neutral gray, so you need to "over expose" it to compensate. The picture needs to be squared up - either at the time the picture is taken or with post processing.', '2003-04-01 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
