(252856, 16510, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Silhouette of the framework works well.  Reflection in second panel from the left is a bit distracting, but not overpowering.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Silhouette of the framework works well.  Reflection in second panel from the left is a bit distracting, but not overpowering.', '2003-04-02 13:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(252858, 16635, 3111, '<td valign="top">on''t you wish you would have saved this for this week''s challenge? :) Strong composition although I would have liked to see the handle come directly to the lower right corner for more dramatic effect (have to reshoot - not going to get the diagonal I am looking for just by cropping, I think - try it) 8</td>', 'on''t you wish you would have saved this for this week''s challenge? :) Strong composition although I would have liked to see the handle come directly to the lower right corner for more dramatic effect (have to reshoot - not going to get the diagonal I am looking for just by cropping, I think - try it) 8', '2003-04-02 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(252859, 16413, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fabulous job taking ordinary items and making an extraordinary shot!  Your desaturated colors and subdued tones work very well in creating a feeling with this shot.</td>', 'Fabulous job taking ordinary items and making an extraordinary shot!  Your desaturated colors and subdued tones work very well in creating a feeling with this shot.', '2003-04-02 13:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(252862, 16662, 7033, '<td valign="top">I certainly wouldn''t want to meet this ''thing'' in an alley after dark!  :)    Actually, you have created a very engaging shot-- duotone effect adds well.</td>', 'I certainly wouldn''t want to meet this ''thing'' in an alley after dark!  :)    Actually, you have created a very engaging shot-- duotone effect adds well.', '2003-04-02 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(252864, 16149, 3111, '<td valign="top">I wonder aloud what this would look like if the background had color, and the hand was in silhoutte.  Good shot - nice visual impact.  The reflection on the right is a tad out of focus though.</td>', 'I wonder aloud what this would look like if the background had color, and the hand was in silhoutte.  Good shot - nice visual impact.  The reflection on the right is a tad out of focus though.', '2003-04-02 13:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
