(252868, 16766, 3111, '<td valign="top">This is just plain neat.  I like it alot, but I like the bottom half more than the top half which seems like it could benefit from some darkening.</td>', 'This is just plain neat.  I like it alot, but I like the bottom half more than the top half which seems like it could benefit from some darkening.', '2003-04-02 13:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
