(253251, 16243, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice symmetry, good idea</td>', 'nice symmetry, good idea', '2003-04-02 22:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(253253, 16507, 6505, '<td valign="top">Works for me except for the border.  The green line in particular.  Good shot though!</td>', 'Works for me except for the border.  The green line in particular.  Good shot though!', '2003-04-02 22:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(253257, 16704, 6505, '<td valign="top">A tight crop on the butterfly would have been nice.  Probably already heard that though.  Those are strange flowers, not familiar with those.</td>', 'A tight crop on the butterfly would have been nice.  Probably already heard that though.  Those are strange flowers, not familiar with those.', '2003-04-02 22:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(253258, 16478, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good light setup to get all the highlights in the same place on each side.</td>', 'Good light setup to get all the highlights in the same place on each side.', '2003-04-02 22:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(253259, 16659, 6325, '<td valign="top">Idea works. I think the tonal range is too narrow and the benches and tree are too blended together. I think setting the levels or increasing contrast would help.</td>', 'Idea works. I think the tonal range is too narrow and the benches and tree are too blended together. I think setting the levels or increasing contrast would help.', '2003-04-02 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(253260, 16222, 6325, '<td valign="top">The sky and clouds are a good shape created by the symmetry.  At first I was going to say the focus should have been on the top of the lighthouse rather than the base, but your way sets off the shape of the sky. Good job.</td>', 'The sky and clouds are a good shape created by the symmetry.  At first I was going to say the focus should have been on the top of the lighthouse rather than the base, but your way sets off the shape of the sky. Good job.', '2003-04-02 22:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(253261, 16522, 6505, '<td valign="top">So small it would make a nice stamp.  Hey, i like it.</td>', 'So small it would make a nice stamp.  Hey, i like it.', '2003-04-02 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(253262, 16549, 6325, '<td valign="top">The head is a little lower on the left than the right - not symmetric and does not meet challenge. <br/>(April''s Fool a day late.) <br/>Good set up and idea for symmetry.  Did you try a longer exposure to get more definition of the face in the two positions? That might be a little stronger. Good job.</td>', 'The head is a little lower on the left than the right - not symmetric and does not meet challenge. (April''s Fool a day late.) Good set up and idea for symmetry.  Did you try a longer exposure to get more definition of the face in the two positions? That might be a little stronger. Good job.', '2003-04-02 22:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(253263, 16753, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the colour of the building.  Was this taken at sunset?</td>', 'I love the colour of the building.  Was this taken at sunset?', '2003-04-02 22:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(253264, 16387, 6325, '<td valign="top">How many times did you have to take this shot?</td>', 'How many times did you have to take this shot?', '2003-04-02 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(253265, 16735, 6505, '<td valign="top">Spooky, but sexy.  I can visualize her suddenly looking up at me with vampire teeth - ready to attack.  Ouch!</td>', 'Spooky, but sexy.  I can visualize her suddenly looking up at me with vampire teeth - ready to attack.  Ouch!', '2003-04-02 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(253266, 16658, 6325, '<td valign="top">Or maybe warring kingdoms. Good use of symmetry without overdoing it.</td>', 'Or maybe warring kingdoms. Good use of symmetry without overdoing it.', '2003-04-02 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(253268, 16638, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to how you achieved this photo without digital manipulation.  Can you tell me?  My only guess (without digital cheating) is some complex set of mirrors.</td>', 'I''m curious as to how you achieved this photo without digital manipulation.  Can you tell me?  My only guess (without digital cheating) is some complex set of mirrors.', '2003-04-02 22:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(253269, 16640, 6505, '<td valign="top">Border is a little outrageous!</td>', 'Border is a little outrageous!', '2003-04-02 22:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(253270, 16280, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the shades of green and highlights on the edges. Good repeating symmetry.</td>', 'Like the shades of green and highlights on the edges. Good repeating symmetry.', '2003-04-02 22:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(253271, 16711, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of this photo.  The shallow depth of field really brings attention to your subject.  Great work.</td>', 'I love the crispness of this photo.  The shallow depth of field really brings attention to your subject.  Great work.', '2003-04-02 22:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(253273, 16768, 6325, '<td valign="top">The muted neutral colors work well. Centering the shoes is a confining for the image. Maybe move the right edge in and the top up.</td>', 'The muted neutral colors work well. Centering the shoes is a confining for the image. Maybe move the right edge in and the top up.', '2003-04-02 22:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(253274, 16625, 6325, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought it was another mirror reflection shot. The use of the tied and untied shoe makes the symmetry pop. Focus could have been sharper.</td>', 'At first glance I thought it was another mirror reflection shot. The use of the tied and untied shoe makes the symmetry pop. Focus could have been sharper.', '2003-04-02 23:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(253277, 16711, 6505, '<td valign="top">Colors are fantastic.  Symmetry is a little week.  I never seen the sky that color.  Very cool.</td>', 'Colors are fantastic.  Symmetry is a little week.  I never seen the sky that color.  Very cool.', '2003-04-02 23:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(253287, 16754, 6548, '<td valign="top">killer</td>', 'killer', '2003-04-02 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(253301, 16292, 6548, '<td valign="top">I a sucker for a good industrial photo.</td>', 'I a sucker for a good industrial photo.', '2003-04-02 23:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(253304, 16583, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the image seems uncomfortable to look at for some reason - perhaps oversharpened or blown highlights, I can''t quite put my finger on it.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the image seems uncomfortable to look at for some reason - perhaps oversharpened or blown highlights, I can''t quite put my finger on it.', '2003-04-02 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(253305, 16013, 1647, '<td valign="top">You seems to have captured an incredible amount of detail in a small image - well done.  It''s quite an interesting photo to look at as a result.</td>', 'You seems to have captured an incredible amount of detail in a small image - well done.  It''s quite an interesting photo to look at as a result.', '2003-04-02 23:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(253310, 15987, 5400, '<td valign="top">I think the border is too thick, and the photography is a little under-exposed. Otherwise, it would make a nice shot.</td>', 'I think the border is too thick, and the photography is a little under-exposed. Otherwise, it would make a nice shot.', '2003-04-03 00:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(253313, 16752, 6548, '<td valign="top">wow, that looks like my cat! I will have to raise the score for that:)</td>', 'wow, that looks like my cat! I will have to raise the score for that:)', '2003-04-03 00:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(253316, 16520, 5400, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! The only thing i would try to change is the shadow under the strawberries, that don''t look good to me.</td>', 'Very nice shot! The only thing i would try to change is the shadow under the strawberries, that don''t look good to me.', '2003-04-03 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(253319, 16688, 5400, '<td valign="top">I liked your idea. The main problem i see here is that the subject is out of focus.</td>', 'I liked your idea. The main problem i see here is that the subject is out of focus.', '2003-04-03 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(253320, 16397, 5400, '<td valign="top">Cool! Very weird perspective :)</td>', 'Cool! Very weird perspective :)', '2003-04-03 00:19:45.000000', NULL, 1);
