(253452, 16396, 7690, '<td valign="top">Kaleidoscope. Good photo. I would have felt more balance if it had zoomed out a bit and showed more repeat of pattern to match top of photo.</td>', 'Kaleidoscope. Good photo. I would have felt more balance if it had zoomed out a bit and showed more repeat of pattern to match top of photo.', '2003-04-03 04:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
