(253464, 16474, 3540, '<td valign="top">If you could''ve kept the whole thing focused, it would''ve made for a much nicer pic.  This has nice colors and pretty good symmetry</td>', 'If you could''ve kept the whole thing focused, it would''ve made for a much nicer pic.  This has nice colors and pretty good symmetry', '2003-04-03 06:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(253466, 16626, 3540, '<td valign="top">With twins, I''d have chosen a more traditional approach, like a cheek to cheek picture or something.  Unfortunately they aren''t quite symmetrical but they sure are cute kids.</td>', 'With twins, I''d have chosen a more traditional approach, like a cheek to cheek picture or something.  Unfortunately they aren''t quite symmetrical but they sure are cute kids.', '2003-04-03 06:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(253467, 16498, 3540, '<td valign="top">You''d have had it nailed if you would''ve cut the flag off I think.  Pretty good image despite but the flag wrecks the symmetry part for me.</td>', 'You''d have had it nailed if you would''ve cut the flag off I think.  Pretty good image despite but the flag wrecks the symmetry part for me.', '2003-04-03 06:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
