(253477, 16640, 6999, '<td valign="top">Way too much framing/bordering for me, and I can''t make out what''s going on: IMO, abstract images need to be really special to work with odd focus - especially b/w shots. Yes, it meets the idea of ''symmetry'' - but in a very straightforward way, not really a compositional way.</td>', 'Way too much framing/bordering for me, and I can''t make out what''s going on: IMO, abstract images need to be really special to work with odd focus - especially b/w shots. Yes, it meets the idea of ''symmetry'' - but in a very straightforward way, not really a compositional way.', '2003-04-03 07:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(253478, 16124, 6999, '<td valign="top">Up there with the top shots this challenge - something just prevents it being my favourite, but I don''t think i could say what exactly - still makes the top 5.</td>', 'Up there with the top shots this challenge - something just prevents it being my favourite, but I don''t think i could say what exactly - still makes the top 5.', '2003-04-03 07:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
