(253801, 16735, 6667, '<td valign="top">Neat!  very neat!  Clean shot. . . so much so that the tattoo became a slight distraction. Still high mark from me.</td>', 'Neat!  very neat!  Clean shot. . . so much so that the tattoo became a slight distraction. Still high mark from me.', '2003-04-03 19:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
