(254103, 16522, 2798, '<td valign="top">Way way too small Im afraid. Would love to have seen more detail in this shot. 5 - floyd</td>', 'Way way too small Im afraid. Would love to have seen more detail in this shot. 5 - floyd', '2003-04-04 09:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
