(254106, 16494, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very very harsh light seems blown out which is a shame for this delicate looking music box. I think I''d rather have seen it in softer light and perhaps even softer focus. 6 - floyd</td>', 'Very very harsh light seems blown out which is a shame for this delicate looking music box. I think I''d rather have seen it in softer light and perhaps even softer focus. 6 - floyd', '2003-04-04 09:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(254107, 16176, 2798, '<td valign="top">Picture postcard worthy. Lovely colour in this one and you obviously went to the trouble of steadying the camera on something which was well worth the effort. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Picture postcard worthy. Lovely colour in this one and you obviously went to the trouble of steadying the camera on something which was well worth the effort. 8 - floyd', '2003-04-04 09:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(254108, 16336, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - almost modern arty. Love the colour too. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Nice idea - almost modern arty. Love the colour too. 8 - floyd', '2003-04-04 10:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(254114, 16653, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting design of a building.  I like the old look to the photo.  It looks vintage ''50s all the way.  Pretty good symmetry too.</td>', 'Interesting design of a building.  I like the old look to the photo.  It looks vintage ''50s all the way.  Pretty good symmetry too.', '2003-04-04 10:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(254115, 16272, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting effects.  The photo has a very grainy appearance to it that really turns me off to it.  It looks like it was taken thru a window screen.  The star filter effects look almost fake because they aren''t 6 or 8 pt. filters.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen a 7pt. filter.   This is a good idea for a pic but needs some work on the execution of the pic</td>', 'Interesting lighting effects.  The photo has a very grainy appearance to it that really turns me off to it.  It looks like it was taken thru a window screen.  The star filter effects look almost fake because they aren''t 6 or 8 pt. filters.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen a 7pt. filter.   This is a good idea for a pic but needs some work on the execution of the pic', '2003-04-04 10:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(254116, 16635, 3540, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t see this as symmetry.  It is a very well taken colorful cheery photo though.  My compliments to that, but in regards the challenge, I don''t feel this is a good example.</td>', 'Personally I don''t see this as symmetry.  It is a very well taken colorful cheery photo though.  My compliments to that, but in regards the challenge, I don''t feel this is a good example.', '2003-04-04 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(254117, 16400, 3540, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this photo is very flat.  This looks more 2 dimensional than it is.  THe colors are nice and the framing isn''t bad but the photo needs some depth and I believe lighting is the way to achieve that.  I also don''t like the little white things in the center of the flower.</td>', 'The lighting on this photo is very flat.  This looks more 2 dimensional than it is.  THe colors are nice and the framing isn''t bad but the photo needs some depth and I believe lighting is the way to achieve that.  I also don''t like the little white things in the center of the flower.', '2003-04-04 10:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(254118, 16753, 3540, '<td valign="top">Outstanding color and clarity in this photo.  Nice symmetry to boot.  Perfectly framed.  My only complaint is that the sky is stark white.  Looks like it was trying to get blue on the edges, but unfortunately is mostly white.  Great photo though - 9</td>', 'Outstanding color and clarity in this photo.  Nice symmetry to boot.  Perfectly framed.  My only complaint is that the sky is stark white.  Looks like it was trying to get blue on the edges, but unfortunately is mostly white.  Great photo though - 9', '2003-04-04 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(254120, 16520, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well shot.  I wouldn''t have cropped this so tight.  Awesome colors and pretty good clarity.  overall a really nice shot</td>', 'Good idea and well shot.  I wouldn''t have cropped this so tight.  Awesome colors and pretty good clarity.  overall a really nice shot', '2003-04-04 10:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(254121, 16508, 3540, '<td valign="top">Tremendous macro.  Great clarity and color.  You must''ve backlit this, it looks awesome.  The framing is great too.  I like the corner to corner flow of the photo. -9</td>', 'Tremendous macro.  Great clarity and color.  You must''ve backlit this, it looks awesome.  The framing is great too.  I like the corner to corner flow of the photo. -9', '2003-04-04 10:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(254122, 16668, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I wasn''t the only one thinking chess when it came to this challenge.  I didn''t use any of those pics, but I was thinking about it.  Good reflections and nice clear shot.  A bit cold I think but overall good</td>', 'I''m glad I wasn''t the only one thinking chess when it came to this challenge.  I didn''t use any of those pics, but I was thinking about it.  Good reflections and nice clear shot.  A bit cold I think but overall good', '2003-04-04 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(254123, 16153, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  Hate the border but the picture is pretty good.  Didn''t expect this type of photo but it works.  Nice pic</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  Hate the border but the picture is pretty good.  Didn''t expect this type of photo but it works.  Nice pic', '2003-04-04 10:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(254124, 16749, 3540, '<td valign="top">Couple things with this picture.  The aperture has to be smaller for this photo to work.  The lemon looks focused at the top but the orange is out of focus, considerably so for this type of shot.  The blue is way oversaturated because the orange appears black around the edges of it.   Honestly I think the idea is very good though.</td>', 'Couple things with this picture.  The aperture has to be smaller for this photo to work.  The lemon looks focused at the top but the orange is out of focus, considerably so for this type of shot.  The blue is way oversaturated because the orange appears black around the edges of it.   Honestly I think the idea is very good though.', '2003-04-04 10:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(254125, 16640, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract.  I have no idea what it is.  The whole frame thing is very annoying to me.  But the pic is cool.</td>', 'Cool abstract.  I have no idea what it is.  The whole frame thing is very annoying to me.  But the pic is cool.', '2003-04-04 10:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
