(254141, 16627, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just awesome nature shot.  Too bad the stuff under him wasn''t in focus.  But still a very good shot.  I think a little tighter crop would''ve done him some good if you had the pixels to spare.  Great job -9</td>', 'Just awesome nature shot.  Too bad the stuff under him wasn''t in focus.  But still a very good shot.  I think a little tighter crop would''ve done him some good if you had the pixels to spare.  Great job -9', '2003-04-04 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
