(254242, 16348, 772, '<td valign="top">This is really neat... I think this sculpture/architecture has been here before... i love it and hope you have some additional photos that you can share after the challenge... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is really neat... I think this sculpture/architecture has been here before... i love it and hope you have some additional photos that you can share after the challenge... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-04 13:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(254247, 16732, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot.  Love the perspective, the reflections, especially the reflections of the middle part into the next part.  Really really impressive.  Nice work - 9<br/></td>', 'Wow!  Great shot.  Love the perspective, the reflections, especially the reflections of the middle part into the next part.  Really really impressive.  Nice work - 9', '2003-04-04 14:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(254251, 16704, 3540, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Well lit and "posed" as well.  overall a very nice image</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Well lit and "posed" as well.  overall a very nice image', '2003-04-04 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(254252, 16625, 7010, '<td valign="top">Great! At first sight, it looked as if you put the shoe on a mirror. Nice effect! (or is it just me ;o) Regards.</td>', 'Great! At first sight, it looked as if you put the shoe on a mirror. Nice effect! (or is it just me ;o) Regards.', '2003-04-04 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(254253, 16329, 7010, '<td valign="top">Love the angle. Good job!</td>', 'Love the angle. Good job!', '2003-04-04 14:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(254255, 16644, 7010, '<td valign="top">Keyboards.....again! But in an attractive and original composition. Welldone!</td>', 'Keyboards.....again! But in an attractive and original composition. Welldone!', '2003-04-04 14:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(254260, 16013, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice high key shot.  Good symmetry and awesome framing and perspective.  If it wasn''t quite so high key, I''d give you a 10 but its a little bright for my personal tastes.  Great image though.</td>', 'Nice high key shot.  Good symmetry and awesome framing and perspective.  If it wasn''t quite so high key, I''d give you a 10 but its a little bright for my personal tastes.  Great image though.', '2003-04-04 14:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(254263, 16301, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry shot.  A lot of detail is lost though due to the very small size of the photo.  Really a nice shot, but better if we could see it bigger.</td>', 'Great symmetry shot.  A lot of detail is lost though due to the very small size of the photo.  Really a nice shot, but better if we could see it bigger.', '2003-04-04 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(254266, 16769, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good image.  Very creative idea.  The mirror reflection looks really nice.  Good job.</td>', 'Good image.  Very creative idea.  The mirror reflection looks really nice.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(254267, 16563, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like something you''d find in the far east.  Good symmetry but i think this needs something, maybe color.  Its a good start but it just doesn''t have the wow factor in the composition, despite being well conceived and taken.</td>', 'Looks like something you''d find in the far east.  Good symmetry but i think this needs something, maybe color.  Its a good start but it just doesn''t have the wow factor in the composition, despite being well conceived and taken.', '2003-04-04 14:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(254268, 16125, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Really neat image of the water flowing.  How did you cature the water so clearly?? Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  Really neat image of the water flowing.  How did you cature the water so clearly?? Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(254269, 16397, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like a worthy structure to photograph.  I think a little better perspective or angle and a little better framing would really make it a lot better of a photo.  Good concept and choice of subject though.</td>', 'This looks like a worthy structure to photograph.  I think a little better perspective or angle and a little better framing would really make it a lot better of a photo.  Good concept and choice of subject though.', '2003-04-04 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(254270, 16080, 6451, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much to this image.  What are you taking a photo of??</td>', 'I don''t see much to this image.  What are you taking a photo of??', '2003-04-04 14:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(254271, 16616, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think I saw the opposite of this perspective with 2 knights and a king.  The reflection on the piece draws mixed emotions.  I like it because it''s different but I also think it may take away slightly from the image as a whole.  If the 2 pawns weren''t in the background, I think I would prefer it.  But with them there I think this draws attention away from them.  Extremely well photographed. - 9</td>', 'I think I saw the opposite of this perspective with 2 knights and a king.  The reflection on the piece draws mixed emotions.  I like it because it''s different but I also think it may take away slightly from the image as a whole.  If the 2 pawns weren''t in the background, I think I would prefer it.  But with them there I think this draws attention away from them.  Extremely well photographed. - 9', '2003-04-04 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(254272, 16511, 3540, '<td valign="top">Crop a little off the bottom and I give you a 10.  Why can''t I have this kind of scenery?  No fair!!  Truly amazing image. - 9</td>', 'Crop a little off the bottom and I give you a 10.  Why can''t I have this kind of scenery?  No fair!!  Truly amazing image. - 9', '2003-04-04 14:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(254273, 16581, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and lighting.  Good idea.  The photo has a lot of value and pattern in it.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image and lighting.  Good idea.  The photo has a lot of value and pattern in it.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(254274, 16556, 3540, '<td valign="top">Why the heavy angle to this shot?  I think that de-emphasizes the symmetry you have with this shot.</td>', 'Why the heavy angle to this shot?  I think that de-emphasizes the symmetry you have with this shot.', '2003-04-04 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(254275, 16474, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and idea.  This looks a little blurry to me though.  Nice bright colors as well.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image and idea.  This looks a little blurry to me though.  Nice bright colors as well.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(254276, 16738, 6451, '<td valign="top">Is this symmetry??  I''m not sure if I would consider it being that.  Nice effect and color choice.</td>', 'Is this symmetry??  I''m not sure if I would consider it being that.  Nice effect and color choice.', '2003-04-04 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(254277, 16549, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  How did you take this picture??  Creative idea as well.</td>', 'Nice image.  How did you take this picture??  Creative idea as well.', '2003-04-04 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(254279, 16656, 6451, '<td valign="top">Creative image and good focus.  This image seems a little bit boring to me.  I think it may need something else maybe in front, and then use the bricks as the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Creative image and good focus.  This image seems a little bit boring to me.  I think it may need something else maybe in front, and then use the bricks as the background.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(254282, 16130, 6451, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice image.  Very good place to take this image as well.  The only thing is that the bottom of the image seems to be a little bit too dark. Good job though.</td>', 'Wow, nice image.  Very good place to take this image as well.  The only thing is that the bottom of the image seems to be a little bit too dark. Good job though.', '2003-04-04 14:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(254283, 16174, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and good lighting choice.  I also like the colors that you used to photograph this image.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image and good lighting choice.  I also like the colors that you used to photograph this image.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(254285, 16743, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.   I really like how this subject makes the image look like it was taken from a long time ago.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.   I really like how this subject makes the image look like it was taken from a long time ago.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
