(254288, 16577, 6451, '<td valign="top">Wow, this photo is very nice.  Not only does it have nice colors, but is also displays a lot of patterns.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow, this photo is very nice.  Not only does it have nice colors, but is also displays a lot of patterns.  Good job.', '2003-04-04 14:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
