(254295, 16562, 3540, '<td valign="top">My only gripe about this pic is the drab look to the sky.  It really makes this beautiful house look a little more drab.  It needs the contrast from the sky to bring out its wonderful shape and color.  Like this it kind of fades into the sky.</td>', 'My only gripe about this pic is the drab look to the sky.  It really makes this beautiful house look a little more drab.  It needs the contrast from the sky to bring out its wonderful shape and color.  Like this it kind of fades into the sky.', '2003-04-04 14:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(254298, 16753, 2899, '<td valign="top">I love architecture too. Great Pic</td>', 'I love architecture too. Great Pic', '2003-04-04 15:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
