(254367, 16709, 509, '<td valign="top">The composition of this draws the viewer all around the image, it really flows well. - 9 - Mav</td>', 'The composition of this draws the viewer all around the image, it really flows well. - 9 - Mav', '2003-04-04 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(254368, 16768, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the coloring of this.  I think a better background would be sand, since sandals are something that, to me, convey summer (beach tie in here)...  As it is the subject isn''t that compelling, just my opinion though</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the coloring of this.  I think a better background would be sand, since sandals are something that, to me, convey summer (beach tie in here)...  As it is the subject isn''t that compelling, just my opinion though', '2003-04-04 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(254369, 16067, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I think the symmetry is stretched a little.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I think the symmetry is stretched a little.', '2003-04-04 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(254371, 16627, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the mallard.  I think this is a great shot, but the blurring background blends with the wings a little and distracts me from the subject.  This is a nice pan focus shot, but I wonder how it would look if a higher shutter speed could have been used to stop the motion of the background as well.</td>', 'Nice focus on the mallard.  I think this is a great shot, but the blurring background blends with the wings a little and distracts me from the subject.  This is a nice pan focus shot, but I wonder how it would look if a higher shutter speed could have been used to stop the motion of the background as well.', '2003-04-04 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(254372, 16651, 509, '<td valign="top">Is the color reflection on the swan from the sunset?  You really captured this well.  Definitely symmetrical, and one of my favorites this round, nice job</td>', 'Is the color reflection on the swan from the sunset?  You really captured this well.  Definitely symmetrical, and one of my favorites this round, nice job', '2003-04-04 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
