(254861, 16758, 4380, '<td valign="top">One of my top favorite this challenge...Youve got   my approval rating of 10, the composition is so amazing, with its textures,lines, patterns, and its ligh colour. Honestly (im guilty) that i rarely gve a comments because my internet is so slow..i got bored waiting.  this week i tried to post this comments because you deserved it.  congrats and hope you''ll  get the blue ribbon.</td>', 'One of my top favorite this challenge...Youve got   my approval rating of 10, the composition is so amazing, with its textures,lines, patterns, and its ligh colour. Honestly (im guilty) that i rarely gve a comments because my internet is so slow..i got bored waiting.  this week i tried to post this comments because you deserved it.  congrats and hope you''ll  get the blue ribbon.', '2003-04-05 23:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
