(254865, 16556, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here, but I think some editing work needs to be done to give this photo the focus to match the title.   I copied the photo and put it in Photoshop and rotated it until the horizon was level and cropped out the lights in the background and as much of the people in the foreground as possible, and i I think the symmetry shows much better.  Try it -- or let me know by e-mail and I''ll send you what I did very quickly to balance the picture so that it doesn''t have quite the same "snapshot" quality to it.</td>', 'I like your idea here, but I think some editing work needs to be done to give this photo the focus to match the title.   I copied the photo and put it in Photoshop and rotated it until the horizon was level and cropped out the lights in the background and as much of the people in the foreground as possible, and i I think the symmetry shows much better.  Try it -- or let me know by e-mail and I''ll send you what I did very quickly to balance the picture so that it doesn''t have quite the same "snapshot" quality to it.', '2003-04-05 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
