(255146, 16630, 7190, '<td valign="top">nice  intresting cloud formation</td>', 'nice  intresting cloud formation', '2003-04-06 13:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(255153, 16631, 7671, '<td valign="top">The form and textures and amazing. The ''everydayness'' of the object, and often unobserved symmetry of the shoelace is visually interesting and brought to life by your great shot. I am only unsure about the border, which seems either too small or unnecessary. I expect either removing it, or increasing it''s size a few pixels would make quite a difference. None-the-less a great shot.</td>', 'The form and textures and amazing. The ''everydayness'' of the object, and often unobserved symmetry of the shoelace is visually interesting and brought to life by your great shot. I am only unsure about the border, which seems either too small or unnecessary. I expect either removing it, or increasing it''s size a few pixels would make quite a difference. None-the-less a great shot.', '2003-04-06 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(255154, 16653, 5266, '<td valign="top">The light post just throws it off.  A different cropping would have helped here.  I like the photo though</td>', 'The light post just throws it off.  A different cropping would have helped here.  I like the photo though', '2003-04-06 13:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
