(255156, 16508, 7671, '<td valign="top">Nature really rocks. I love this photo -- it captures one of those common things we almost ignore and reminds us of the infinite detail. Well captured, and beautifully simple.</td>', 'Nature really rocks. I love this photo -- it captures one of those common things we almost ignore and reminds us of the infinite detail. Well captured, and beautifully simple.', '2003-04-06 14:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
