(255181, 16179, 7671, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good shot! The trees to the right somewhat distract from the perfect symmetry, but the ship itself is interesting! A closer (horizontal) crop might make all the difference (emphasis on the symmetry rather than ship). Really like the concept!</td>', 'Great idea and good shot! The trees to the right somewhat distract from the perfect symmetry, but the ship itself is interesting! A closer (horizontal) crop might make all the difference (emphasis on the symmetry rather than ship). Really like the concept!', '2003-04-06 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
