(255658, 16732, 2989, '<td valign="top"><b>Thank you very much to everyone who left comments and voted!</b> <br/> <br/>Symmetry was such a great challenge to shoot and to vote on.  It produced some amazing entries!  I am privileged and excited to recieve my 2nd ribbon.  It only inspires me to shoot more and to become better.  The color version of this shot can be found at:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=17597" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=17597</a></td>', 'Thank you very much to everyone who left comments and voted!  Symmetry was such a great challenge to shoot and to vote on.  It produced some amazing entries!  I am privileged and excited to recieve my 2nd ribbon.  It only inspires me to shoot more and to become better.  The color version of this shot can be found at: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=17597', '2003-04-07 01:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
