(256938, 16162, 1005, '<td valign="top">The lighting refracted within the ice is very nice.  Stunning to look at, but even with your hint, it''s hard to see this as an example of symmetry.  Creativity is great, but on average, you have about 5 seconds to capture your audience.  If you ask them to think more than 5 seconds, you''re in trouble, score-wise.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but had I, I doubt I would have scored this higher than a 5, but then again, I''m an easy grader and feel that if I''m missing something, it''s me.  <br/>For beauty alone, this is a very nice, colorful shot.</td>', 'The lighting refracted within the ice is very nice.  Stunning to look at, but even with your hint, it''s hard to see this as an example of symmetry.  Creativity is great, but on average, you have about 5 seconds to capture your audience.  If you ask them to think more than 5 seconds, you''re in trouble, score-wise.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but had I, I doubt I would have scored this higher than a 5, but then again, I''m an easy grader and feel that if I''m missing something, it''s me.  For beauty alone, this is a very nice, colorful shot.', '2003-04-07 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(256955, 16711, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful shot.  I didn''t vote on the symmetry challenge (didn''t enter it), but I think I would have scored this a 6, maybe a 7.  The challenge aspect isn''t that clear.  I see the spikes and there is some pattern to it, but it doesn''t stay consistant.  Most spots have 4 similarly sized spikes, but some extra (small) spikes, too.  Color saturation is very nice.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful shot.  I didn''t vote on the symmetry challenge (didn''t enter it), but I think I would have scored this a 6, maybe a 7.  The challenge aspect isn''t that clear.  I see the spikes and there is some pattern to it, but it doesn''t stay consistant.  Most spots have 4 similarly sized spikes, but some extra (small) spikes, too.  Color saturation is very nice.', '2003-04-07 15:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(257078, 16732, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''ve just seen the colour version and have to say, why on earth did you make it B&amp;W?!! LOL.<br/>Cracking shot, well done.</td>', 'I''ve just seen the colour version and have to say, why on earth did you make it B&W?!! LOL.Cracking shot, well done.', '2003-04-07 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(257107, 16389, 4411, '<td valign="top">I shoulda guessed this was you, though I thought ''nah, he wouldn''t do another chess shot''. LOL.<br/>Great shot, needless to say I like it.</td>', 'I shoulda guessed this was you, though I thought ''nah, he wouldn''t do another chess shot''. LOL.Great shot, needless to say I like it.', '2003-04-07 16:23:31.000000', NULL, 0),
