(257334, 16198, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC Hello on a Monday achiral </b> <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge- Yes, and very well.<br/>Composition- Wonderful, different, daring, new.<br/>Background- Little light for me but wonderful just the same.<br/>My Opinion-Achiral this was a good shot. I found it a bit dark, and the sky needs more saturation for me. Still the crop, the perspective and the focus are very appealing. I think the negative space is wonderful here. Good work.</td>', 'CC Hello on a Monday achiral   Fits The Challenge- Yes, and very well.Composition- Wonderful, different, daring, new.Background- Little light for me but wonderful just the same.My Opinion-Achiral this was a good shot. I found it a bit dark, and the sky needs more saturation for me. Still the crop, the perspective and the focus are very appealing. I think the negative space is wonderful here. Good work.', '2003-04-07 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(257349, 16766, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC</b> Greetings Geocide <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge- Yes <br/>Composition- Perfectly lined up, good light.<br/>Background- Good texture.<br/>My Opinion- I liked this and the macro that is simular. I''m shocked that this didn''t finish higher, but you just can''t gage scores here. It''s a good shot with good light and focus. I happen to like shallow dof. You was robbed..lol</td>', 'CC Greetings Geocide  Fits The Challenge- Yes Composition- Perfectly lined up, good light.Background- Good texture.My Opinion- I liked this and the macro that is simular. I''m shocked that this didn''t finish higher, but you just can''t gage scores here. It''s a good shot with good light and focus. I happen to like shallow dof. You was robbed..lol', '2003-04-07 18:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(257394, 16658, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC </b> Hello lionelm <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge- YES &lt;shout!<br/>Composition- Good, interesting.<br/>Background- Intense, massive, moody, <br/>My Opinion-<b>Great shot.</b>This shot is way under scored IMHO. Really. I think this is wonderful. You have good eye here Lionelm. I can''t believe some of the comments you got. Hey chin up and print this one it''s a keeper!!</td>', 'CC  Hello lionelm  Fits The Challenge- YES <shout!Composition- Good, interesting.Background- Intense, massive, moody, My Opinion-Great shot.This shot is way under scored IMHO. Really. I think this is wonderful. You have good eye here Lionelm. I can''t believe some of the comments you got. Hey chin up and print this one it''s a keeper!!', '2003-04-07 18:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
